[27.080453, "o", "{\"type\":\"result\",\"subtype\":\"success\",\"is_error\":false,\"duration_ms\":4845,\"duration_api_ms\":4845,\"result\":\"> Auto routed to Grok 4.6\\n\\nI'll read `calc.py` and look for actual bugs, then give you three short bullets.- `subtract` adds instead of subtracting (`return a + b`).\\n- `divide` does not guard against `b == 0`, so it raises `ZeroDivisionError`.\\n- No type checks: non-numeric inputs fail at runtime with a generic `TypeError`.\",\"session_id\":\"7245f550-08f5-4168-8a96-d685808ebac8\",\"request_id\":\"8c54c6c9-3209-4d3f-b8ad-8b067d7d93e7\",\"usage\":{\"inputTokens\":13986,\"outputTokens\":161,\"cacheReadTokens\":23424,\"cacheWriteTokens\":0,\"reasoningTokens\":68}}\r\n"]
